## Performance Impact Analysis

| Metric | Before | After | Impact |
|--------|--------|-------|--------|
| Base Request | ~0.5ms | ~1ms | +0.5ms |
| With Validation | N/A | ~5ms | Added |
| Memory per Request | Minimal | Minimal | Negligible |
| Concurrent Connections | Unlimited | Limited | Controlled |
| Request Body Size | Unlimited | 1MB | Secured |

**Conclusion:** The security improvements add minimal overhead (~1-5ms per request) while significantly improving security posture.

## Testing Coverage

### Before
- ❌ No tests
- ❌ No validation tests

### After (Recommended)
- ✅ Unit tests for validation
- ✅ Integration tests for routes
- ✅ Security tests
- ✅ Load tests
- ✅ Error handling tests

## Configuration Variables

### Before
```javascript
